\startchapter[reference=conclusion, title={Conclusion}]
% extensibility
As demands on reliability and interaction grow, more practices from software engineering are finding their way into biological science.
Instead of ad-hoc text-based formats incompatibly modified to suit situational needs, standards arise that are designed to be extensible.

